    "Host Measurement Range": "Absorbed dose rate: 10nGy/h - 100mGy/h, Dose equivalent rate: 10nSv/h - 100mSv/h",
    "Neutron Probe Detector": "3He proportional counter tube + polyethylene moderator (spherical)",
    "Sensor Pressure": "8 atmospheres",
